 ’re reading QUEER WEREWOLVES DESTROY CAPITALISM @mjlyonswrites ! Join us
  for snacks and chats May 29th at 6pm about this great little collection o
 f gay smutty paranormal goodness. Sexy\, capitalism-defying adventures tak
