 y Toronto\, from the tender to the consentacled\, these tales of unapologe
 tically queer\, unabashedly smutty speculative fiction will thrill\, titil
 late\, and delight. See you at Queer Fears Book Club! 🏳️‍🌈👻
 🖤📚 #littleghostsbooks #toronto #queerfears #bookclub #lgbtqa ‍
