DESCRIPTION:Pride month is bringing the heat! Burn is back June 13th and g
 racing the decks alongside myself is techno dj and producer NOS-TALGIA! A 
 rising force in the Toronto underground with a distinct style. Excited to 
 hear what magic she brings to the dancefloor. NOS-talgia embodies a deep p
 assion for electronic music and the profound moments of self discovery fou
 nd on dancefloors across the world for nearly a decade. Her devotion to th
 e underground has drawn inspiration from a wide spectrum of genres\, thoug
 h it was during her first trip to Detroit that she fell in love with techn
 o\, an experience that propelled her forward to leave her own mark. Her so
 und moves through raw and hypnotic techno\, peaktime energy\, and breakbea
 t driven rhythms. Originating from Toronto\, NOS-talgia guides listeners o
 n a journey where deep and ethereal melodies merge seamlessly with gritty\
 , driving underground techno. Her sets thrive in afterhour and underground
  environments\, where tension\, atmosphere\, and rhythm take priority. Now
  as a burgeoning artist with EP releases on respected labels such as Red C
 hannel Records and Starskream Records\, NOS-talgia continues to build mome
 ntum internationally as a driving force in the electronic music landscape.
  Artwork done by @ffhung ‍
