 amp\; Polter Guy Get ready for a one-of-a-kind Drag Brunch experience at T
 he Royal Sonesta! Expect high-energy drag performances\, delicious food an
 d drinks\, and fabulous prizes! Doors open at 11:30am! 💸 Please remembe
