BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hump Day Bump Redux!
DTSTART:20260624T190000
DTEND:20260624T190000
UID:fc0d39adbe3718f27b550734204c7c18@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Back in the aughts\, we regularly convened at the dilapidated 
 Gladstone Hotel for some queer joy. On Wednesday nights\, we gathered week
 ly in the carpeted Melody Bar for Hump Day Bump hosted by May Brand and Sa
 ndy DeAlmeida alongside a rotating DJ roster of local artists. The other p
 arty was Foxhole\, in the Ballroom\, presented by host DJs Bink\, May Bran
 d\, and Shane MacKinnon also featuring local bands and performers monthly.
