 00+ WLW the ONLY way to end your Pride 2026 weekend! (2:30PM - LATE) Join 
 us 13 floors above Toronto with 360 degree views of the city\, poolside wi
 th exclusive venue access for us to close out Pride 2026! Sounds provided 
 by JAX\, Soundboi\, Teray\, Thirdeye\, Cookie Doh\, Hey Hey SK. Hip-hop\, 
 Bangers\, R&amp\;B\, Reggaeton\, Classics\, House\, Club edits and more. F
 ood + BBQ Menu will be available and shared closer to date. Swimming If yo
 u are swimming\, please note that there will be towels available to rent f
 or a fee. You can also bring your own towel. *Please note there are no loc
 kers onsite* Poolside Cabanas There are only 5 Poolside Cabanas available 
 (8-20 people can fit in a cabana) and 10 Skyview Booths available (5-10 pe
 ople can fit in skyview booth) 3 Day All Access VIP Pass We have a limited
  amount of VIP wristbands which will get you into all 3 About Last Night P
 ride Events and include Linebypass. Reserve yours here: https://www.eventb
 rite.ca/e/1987014273180 Accessibility The rooftop is accessible to those w
 ith mobility needs. The pools are not accessible. Please reach out to us p
 rior to the event in an email and we will happily coordinate elevator serv
 ice with the venue. Photography and Video There will be photography and vi
 deo at this event\, which will be used for promotional material in future.
  By entering\, you agree to possibly be in videos or pictures. If you do n
 ot wish to be in pictures\, please do not pose for them. Kindly tell the p
 hotographer no thank you. Thank you for your understanding! Weather This i
 s a rain or shine event. In the event it rains we will move the event indo
 ors. Who this party is for: *Hide and Seek is a queer party for LGBTQIA+ w
 omen that includes trans\, nonbinary folks. Queer men and trans men are we
 lcome in this space. This is not an event for CIS het men. This is a priva
 te Pride event and safe space for the LGBTQIA+ community. If you at any ti
 me feel unsafe\, immediately contact us via Instagram DM and let us know s
 o we can address the concerns right away. Sponsors We’re proud to have C
 OCO Rum / Vodka joining us as a sponsor this year. Founded right here in T
 oronto\, COCO is more than just a local brand\, they show up for community
 . Their continued support of LGBTQIA+ spaces\, talent\, and events like ou
 rs is something we truly appreciate! Drink COCO Products and support queer
  events / talent. Follow us on insta: @aboutlastnightto This event is +19\
 , valid physical ID is required to enter. ‍
LOCATION:Lavelle\, 627 King St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/soaked-x-wlw-pride-rooftop-pool-party-day-
 night-sapphic-party
